<title>USA: TENNIS-CHICAGO WOMEN'S RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-CHICAGO WOMEN'S RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from the $450,000</p>
<p>Ameritech Cup women's tennis tournament Friday (prefix number</p>
<p>denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Quarter-finals</p>
<p>Jennifer Capriati (U.S.) beat Meredith McGrath (U.S.) 5-2</p>
<p>(retired)</p>
<p>2-Jana Novotna (Czech Republic) beat 7-Brenda Schultz</p>
<p>McCarthy (Netherlands) 6-2 7-5</p>
<p>5-Martina Hingis (Switzerland) beat 3-Lindsay Davenport</p>
<p>(U.S.) 6-3 6-7 (5-7) 6-2</p>
</text>
